WEBVTT

00:33:58.300 --> 00:34:02.496
And so, people were much more
receptive to my ideas.

00:34:02.520 --> 00:34:04.696
AG: With that credibility under her belt,

00:34:04.720 --> 00:34:07.606
Carmen also reframed her heretical ideas

00:34:07.630 --> 00:34:10.356
as conforming to the CIA's values.

00:34:10.380 --> 00:34:13.990
CM: So instead of standing
on the soapbox and saying,

00:34:14.014 --> 00:34:18.326
"We have to be completely different,
or we're going to die!" you know,

00:34:18.350 --> 00:34:21.376
which is what I did in the late '90s,

00:34:21.400 --> 00:34:23.514
I think you need to say,

00:34:23.538 --> 00:34:28.254
"The organization has this objective,

00:34:28.278 --> 00:34:32.821
and I think these ideas could
help us achieve these objectives